Remove Hot Spot :

First, stop the wifi service:
sudo systemctl stop wifi.service

Disable the service so it doesn't start on boot:
sudo systemctl disable wifi.service

Remove the service file:
sudo rm /etc/systemd/system/wifi.service

Remove the NetworkManager connection profile for the hotspot:
sudo rm /etc/NetworkManager/system-connections/HW-67E41A1F.nmconnection

If you want to be thorough, you could also delete or rename the Python script that creates the hotspot:
sudo mv /home/pi/hiwonder-toolbox/wifi.py /home/pi/hiwonder-toolbox/wifi.py.disabled

